[HEADING=1][DD] Bump - Quick Start & Usage Guide[/HEADING]

[HEADING=2]Installation[/HEADING]
[HEADING=3]1. Upload[/HEADING]
Upload contents to [ICODE]src/addons/cv6/Bump[/ICODE].

[HEADING=3]2. Installation[/HEADING]
[CODE=bash]php cmd.php xf-addon:install cv6/Bump[/CODE]

[HEADING=2]CLI Usage Guide[/HEADING]
To bump an add-on version, execute the [ICODE]cv6:bump[/ICODE] command in your XenForo root directory:

[CODE=bash]php cmd.php cv6:bump Vendor/Addon [type] [state][/CODE]

[HEADING=3]Parameters[/HEADING]
[LIST]
[*][B]Vendor/Addon[/B]: The ID of the add-on to bump (e.g. [ICODE]cv6/DiceRoller[/ICODE]).
[*][B]type[/B] [I](optional)[/I]: Bump type ([ICODE]major[/ICODE], [ICODE]minor[/ICODE], [ICODE]patch[/ICODE], [ICODE]alpha[/ICODE], [ICODE]beta[/ICODE], [ICODE]rc[/ICODE], [ICODE]stable[/ICODE]).
[*][B]state[/B] [I](optional)[/I]: Specific state override if checking release candidate/stability levels.
[/LIST]

[HEADING=3]Usage Examples[/HEADING]
[LIST]
[*][B]Bump patch version[/B] (e.g. 1.0.0 -> 1.0.1):
[CODE=bash]php cmd.php cv6:bump Vendor/Addon patch[/CODE]
[*][B]Bump minor version[/B] (e.g. 1.0.0 -> 1.1.0):
[CODE=bash]php cmd.php cv6:bump Vendor/Addon minor[/CODE]
[*][B]Change stability to stable[/B]:
[CODE=bash]php cmd.php cv6:bump Vendor/Addon stable[/CODE]
[*][B]Interactive prompt[/B]:
[CODE=bash]php cmd.php cv6:bump Vendor/Addon[/CODE]
[/LIST]
